Jump tables switch on the low 32 bits of the index register (the guest bounds-checks it
with cmplwi; stale upper bits fell into __builtin_unreachable, a trap). Also implements
vupkd3d128 float16_2/float16_4, vpkd3d128 float16_2 and vcmpbfp(128), which were traps.

